IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BBATCLI.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(20).
01 WS-A PIC X(24).
01 WS-RC PIC X(02).
01 WS-MSG PIC X(80).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE PIC X(1000).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-LINE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OP WS-A
    UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-OP WS-A
    END-UNSTRING
    EVALUATE WS-OP
        WHEN "eod" PERFORM DO-EOD
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "rc=20"
            DISPLAY "msg=UNKNOWN BATCH OP"
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DO-EOD.
    CALL "BBATEOD" USING WS-RC WS-MSG
    DISPLAY "rc=" WS-RC
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MSG).
